.SH NAME
git-work-flow-list - List the flows, JSON out


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work flow list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the flows: their names, descriptions and arguments, as JSON.

.PP
A flow is one Starlark function stored in refs/work-flows. Its name is the
flow's name, its docstring the description and its parameters the arguments
\fBgit work flow run\fR takes.

.PP
--format text prints one line per flow, the name and its summary line, which
is what the bare \fBgit work flow\fR prints.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-f\fP, \fB--format\fP="json"
	Select the output formatting style. Valid values are [json,text]

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-work-flow(1)\fP
